{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-quick-prompts#card-zh","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-quick-prompts","commit":"9782a2ad90360798d2db1ed39732e890ad4173e2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"快捷指令 Quick Prompts 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的提示词扩展插件。它在对话输入框注册独立的斜杠候选源，输入 `/` 后可按缩写或显示名筛选预设文本，选中候选或直接提交整行 `/缩写` 即可展开。用户可在插件管理配置卡新增、编辑、删除指令，查看调用统计并按名称、添加时间或修改时间排序。每条指令包含缩写、可选显示名和正文；展开内容可直接发送，也可留在草稿继续编辑。配置和统计保存在本机数据文件，无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:825-896","lib/client.js:619-740","lib/index.js:943-980","lib/index.js:900-900"]}
{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-quick-prompts#card-en","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-quick-prompts","commit":"9782a2ad90360798d2db1ed39732e890ad4173e2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Quick Prompts adds slash aliases for reusable text in the DSH web composer. Type `/` to find a prompt, then pick it or submit `/alias` to expand it. Manage prompts and usage in a settings card; choose to send expanded text or leave it in the draft. Data stays in a local file.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:825-896","lib/client.js:619-740","lib/index.js:943-980","lib/index.js:900-900"]}
