{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-quick-prompts#feature-1","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-quick-prompts","commit":"9782a2ad90360798d2db1ed39732e890ad4173e2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"快捷指令 Quick Prompts 的功能「斜杠展开」：在对话输入框输入 `/` 后按缩写或显示名筛选候选，选择一项即可把预设正文替换到草稿；直接提交整行 `/缩写` 也能触发展开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:779-823","lib/client.js:861-896"]}
